  "text_md": "The SPIE NCU student chapter will support the 7 th Vacuum and Surface Sciences Conference of Asia and Australia. The 7 th Vacuum and Surface Sciences Conference of Asia and Australia (VASSCAA-7) will be held from October 5th (Sunday) to 9th (Thursday), 2014 at National Tsing Hua University, Hsinchu, Taiwan.\n\nAbstract Submission\n\n## VASSCAA-7\n\n7th Vacuum and Surface Sciences Conference 0f Asia Australia October 5 - 9, 2014, Hsinchu Taiwan and\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nAndreas Heinrich\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nShangjr Gwo\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nToshio Ando\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nMichikazu Kinsho\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nIBM Almaden Research Center, USA\n\nPvhsics Department at National Tsing Hua University , Taiwan\n\nKanazawa University, Japan\n\nLeader of Accelerator Section II, Accelerator Division, J-PARC Center, Japan",
